      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ranchester%2C_Wyoming"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A thirty-five mile long log flume was once used to float timber from the Bighorn Mountains to the Ranchester mill.",
